%% Template: API request with async webhook confirmation.
%% Use for: create/confirm flows, 3DS, payouts, any call whose final result arrives by webhook.
%% Rules: participants named from the reader's point of view ("Your server"), endpoints in messages,
%% async messages use --) , number steps so the prose can reference them ("In step 3...").
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant S as Your server
    participant A as Example API
    participant P as Payment provider
    C->>S: Checkout
    S->>A: POST /v1/payments
    A->>P: Authorize
    P-->>A: Authorized
    A-->>S: 201 Created (status: pending)
    S-->>C: Show processing screen
    Note over A,P: Capture happens asynchronously
    A--)S: Webhook payment.succeeded
    S-->>A: 200 OK
